{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新久しぶりになってしまってすみません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんっとにごめんなさい\n元気です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まっつんが30くらいの元気だったら、私は70くらいの元気です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ...足して100です。照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/02/14/5352574/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落書きに注目。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「こんにちぴょん。まいやんだお♡」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰が書いた？\nって、分かる人がほとんどですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなぴょんこと川後のひなだお♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちゃんとは運命だから最近よく絡みます。照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このペン油性だから、なかなか落ちませんでした笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなったけど、かずみんハッピーバースデー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アメイジング＼(^o^)／\nおめでとうー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみんのモノマネ極めていくね！\nこれからも、ホワイトハイとしてもよろしく♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かず男(かずお)好きだぁーーーーー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/02/14/5352574/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛のひもQ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は嬉しいことに、毎日お仕事充実させて貰ってます。\n日々たくさんの刺激を受けて、勉強になることがいっぱいあります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私自身も、まだまだ挑戦したいことがたくさんあるのでそこに向かって毎日突き進んでいきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とにかく、毎日楽しいよってこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に、皆さんハッピーバレンタイン♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の気持ち受け取って♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/02/14/5352574/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいやん。"}],"source":"archive"}